{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56938","headline":"泰州民刺禇仁规诗 · 佚名","name":"泰州民刺禇仁规诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多求囊白昧苍苍，兼取人间第一黄。\n（同前）（〖1〗《清异录》：「僞唐贜臣禇仁规窃禄泰州刺史，恶政不可缕举。\n有智民请吻儒爲二诗，皆隐语，凡写数千幅，诣金陵粘贴，事乃上闻。\n诗曰〖略〗。\n黄自隐金银字。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}